      ],
      "description": "Receive and transmit data register, or the low byte of the baud rate divisor when the divisor latch bit is set.",
      "behaviour": "With the divisor latch bit of the line control register clear, a write loads the transmit register and a read takes the received character. With it set, both access the low byte of the baud rate divisor.",
